        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5312, Modern Two-Point Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Rectangular Two-Point Lock will fit most standard pre-drill doors. It is available in 2-3/8 inch backset or 2-3/4 inch backset for doors 1-1/4 inches thick to 1-3/4 inches thick. A dual-keyed entryset, it features a keyed deadbolt as well as a lock on the trim kbo /lever. The Modern Dual Keyed Entryset is available in a wide range of modern finish colors with your choice of accompanying trim knob or lever. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Dual Keyed modern Tubular Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Threaded Tubes and Machine Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Modern Two-Point Locking Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li>Inside Passage Half Spindle</li>\r\n<li>1\" Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li>Full-Lip Strike Plate</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5312-specifications.pdf?v=1704262425\"><b>Emtek 5312 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. The second lock on the exterior handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumbturn on the interior knob/lever and by a key from the exterior. \r\n</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Rectangular Two-Point Lock",
                "description": "The Modern Rectangular Two-Point Lock will fit most standard pre-drill doors. It is available in 2-3/8 inch backset or 2-3/4 inch backset for doors 1-1/4 inches thick to 1-3/4 inches thick. A dual-keyed entryset, it features a keyed deadbolt as well as a lock on the trim kbo /lever. The Modern Dual Keyed Entryset is available in a wide range of modern finish colors with your choice of accompanying trim knob or lever. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Emtek 5312, Modern Two-Point Single Cylinder Entry Door Locksets, Modern Rectangular Two-Point Locks, Emtek 5312, Modern Dual Keyed Entrysets, EMT-5312, Modern Single Cylinder Dual Keyed modern Tubular Locksets, Emtek Modern Two-Point Locking Entry Sets, Emtek 5322, Emtek 5362, double cylinder dual keyed entry sets,"
            },
